#. ~ Description of "cooked cattail stalk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A cooked stalk from a cattail plant.  Its fibrous outer leaves have been "
"stripped away, and now it is quite delicious."
msgstr ""
"Gotowana łodyga pałki wodnej. Usunięto z niej włókniste zewnętrzne liście, a "
"teraz jest całkiem smaczna."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
